# Journey: a member tags scout to vote in words, and scout confirms the vote
# once, through the vote's own confirmation, not a second message saying it.
# Needs Claude.
members maya leo priya
from poll-open

maya: @scout put me down for the beach one with cenotes
expect scout ~ "1 of 3 voted"
expect scout !~ "recorded your vote"
expect state open_poll.votes.+15550000001 = 0
